{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kami Quest</strong> is a whimsical 3D platformer inspired by the golden age of video games. You play as <strong>Sabbath</strong>, an energetic dalmatian exploring the mysterious, ever-shifting world of the <strong>Imagynasium</strong>, a giant living castle filled with oddball spirits, surreal environments, and secrets tucked into every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857790/extras/84ad1fb8a508c4d17655aa21a6e913da.poster.avif?t=1773034904\" width=982 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857790/extras/84ad1fb8a508c4d17655aa21a6e913da.webm?t=1773034904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857790/extras/84ad1fb8a508c4d17655aa21a6e913da.mp4?t=1773034904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into exploration-driven levels, interact with quirky NPCs, and collect keys hidden throughout the castle to uncover the Imagynasium\u2019s deepest mysteries. With a strong emphasis on style, music, and expressive characters, <strong>Kami Quest</strong> is a love letter to childhood wonder and retro platformers. It's a world that feels alive, weird, and worth getting lost in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857790/extras/cb5d6871d81c4a917ddc7dce0ce1335a.poster.avif?t=1773034904\" width=982 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857790/extras/cb5d6871d81c4a917ddc7dce0ce1335a.webm?t=1773034904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857790/extras/cb5d6871d81c4a917ddc7dce0ce1335a.mp4?t=1773034904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857790?t=1773034904","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857790?t=1773034904","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857790/9d44882097e8b66ca10c18eb99f361f267165ab1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773034904","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857790/9d44882097e8b66ca10c18eb99f361f267165ab1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773034904","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4374840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kami Quest</strong> is a whimsical 3D platformer inspired by the golden age of video games. You play as <strong>Sabbath</strong>, an energetic dalmatian exploring the mysterious, ever-shifting world of the <strong>Imagynasium</strong>, a giant living castle filled with oddball spirits, surreal environments, and secrets tucked into every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857790/extras/84ad1fb8a508c4d17655aa21a6e913da.poster.avif?t=1773034904\" width=982 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857790/extras/84ad1fb8a508c4d17655aa21a6e913da.webm?t=1773034904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app